# Class: <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000067> (Civil Time Reference System)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000067> "In traditional astronomical usage, civil time is mean solar time as calculated from midnight as the beginning of the Civil Day."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000067> "Note that Civil Time Reference System is more accurately represented as a Temporal Reference System that participates in an act of usage that is sanctioned by an appropriate civil authority. As such, it should be represented as a defined class."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000067> "Civil Time Reference System"@en)
SubClassOf(<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000067> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001328>)

