# Class: <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000263> (Clock Time System)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000263> "A single Clock Time System does not provide a complete means for identifying or measuring times. Depending on the particular Clock Time System, it may be compatible for use with one or more other Temporal Reference Systems."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000263> "Clock Time System"@en)
