# Class: <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000275> (Spatial Reference System)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000275> "Note that, while reference systems and reference frames are treated as synonyms here, some people treat them as related but separate entities. See: http://www.ggos-portal.org/lang_en/GGOS-Portal/EN/Topics/GeodeticApplications/GeodeticReferenceSystemsAndFrames/GeodeticReferenceSystemsAndFrames.html"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000275> "Spatial Reference System"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001754> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000275> "https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Coordinate_system&oldid=1060461397"^^xsd:anyURI)
SubClassOf(<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000275> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000398>)

