AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001628> "Yankee Time Zone is the same local time as Mike Time Zone, but is 1 Day (i.e. 24 Hours) behind Mike Time Zone as they are on opposite sides of the International Date Line."@en)
