# Individual: <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001660> (International Geomagnetic Reference Field)

AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001660> "This global main field model provides magnetic field values for any location on Earth, e.g. for  navigational purposes (declination) or as a standard for core field subtraction for aeromagnetic surveys. An updated version is adopted by International Association of Geomagnetism and Aeronomy (IAGA) every 5 years)."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001660> "International Geomagnetic Reference Field"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001754> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001660> "Alken, P., Thébault, E., Beggan, C.D. et al. International Geomagnetic Reference Field: the thirteenth generation. Earth Planets Space 73, 49 (2021). https://doi.org/10.1186/s40623-020-01288-x , https://www.iaga-aiga.org/")
ClassAssertion(<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000469> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001660>)

